### 测试hello接口
GET http://localhost:8080/hello

###查询所有学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students

###根据id查询学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1

###根据不存在的id查询学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students/999

###根据非法id查询学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students/0

###添加学生
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "赵六",
  "age": 21,
  "phone": "1380000004"
}

###添加重复id的学生
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "重复学生",
  "age": 20,
  "phone": "1380000999"
}

###添加非法学生数据
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "name": "",
  "age": -1,
  "phone": ""
}

###修改学生
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "赵六修改后",
  "age": 22,
  "phone": "138000005"
}

###修改不存在的学生
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "不存在的学生",
  "age": 22,
  "phone": "138000005"
}

###删除学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/4

###删除不存在的学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/999

###删除学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/0
